        "answer": {
          "short": "$-24x+28$. Expand from the innermost brackets, keeping each term's sign.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}&=-4(-3((-2)(x)+(-2)(-2)-3)-4)\\\\&=-4(-3(-2x+1)-4)\\\\&=-4((-3)(-2x)+(-3)(1)-4)\\\\&=-4(6x-7)\\\\&=(-4)(6x)+(-4)(-7)\\\\&=-24x+28\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
